docs {
  ## Request Dispute — Invalid Order ID

  Tests requesting a dispute with a non-existent order UUID.

  ### Expected Error Response (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Order not found or not in deliverable status"
  }
  ```
}
